{"channelId":"UCSbJhJ_U3f-b30QALwKHn-A","row":["Kittenfoster64",3880,"Channel Description for KittenFoster64:\n\nWelcome to KittenFoster64! 🐾 Here, we are passionate about saving and nurturing animals in need, especially our furry friends - kittens! Join us on this heartwarming journey as we rescue, foster, and rehabilitate these adorable little ones. From heart-melting rescue stories to helpful tips on animal care, our channel is dedicated to creating awareness about animal welfare and the importance of rescue.\n\nEvery view and subscription helps us continue our mission to give these animals the love and care they deserve.\n\n🐱What to Expect:\n- Inspiring rescue stories \n- Kitten care tips \n- Updates on our foster kitties and their journeys to loving homes.\n\nThank you for being a part of our community! Let's spread kindness and compassion for animals together. \n\n#KittenFoster64 #AnimalRescue #Kittens #FosterCare #CatLovers #RescueAnimals\n\n---\n\nFeel free to modify any part of this description to better fit your style or the specific content you plan to create!","","Bangladesh"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCSbJhJ_U3f-b30QALwKHn-A","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCSbJhJ_U3f-b30QALwKHn-A","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:09:52.780Z","channelId":"UCSbJhJ_U3f-b30QALwKHn-A","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"9e2a38f3d8db5f72e268dc23f00e3a787c7193c123d9642a1b17911a368f1cbe","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"81c9eaff8dcf4a5d2ab2f14ebb72348ea76aec8b6c15be77cfb0002856504739"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCSbJhJ_U3f-b30QALwKHn-A","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:09:52.780Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCSbJhJ_U3f-b30QALwKHn-A","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":3880,"raw":"3.88K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCSbJhJ_U3f-b30QALwKHn-A","observedAt":"2026-09-18T1